      "bookId": "mindfully-facing-disease-and-death",
      "bookTitle": "Mindfully Facing Disease and Death",
      "author": "Bhikkhu Analayo",
      "category": "Spirituality",
      "type": "mental-model",
      "headline": "The Borrowed Suitcase",
      "body": "Imagine renting a beat-up suitcase for a weekend road trip. When a zipper gets stuck or the fabric frays, you do not weep or take it personally\u2014it was never yours to keep anyway. Your physical frame is a loaner vehicle on a temporary lease.",
